      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b02a5c4e579af8947fbd06a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e9726c3cba9516f94f7c0514ff7ff9ac4eee99fd09299c7a029ca86f3fa8d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef07e8189508416b6b64e31a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起…",
      "source_fingerprint": "99697494ec350e5b62f67775e30d1a8913a4e65ac8d34fd47d04536cca99c91b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf33711eb088430f72f25054",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的这个…也很期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4771dc542def76f73f9fb9c21a3730b7ef1da1e884cd77ecd415a56b7345b5a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70283141553b713a32862277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…可能稍微、\n有点…疲惫了呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4b3970c91a2495fecfdfe393f4bb60c67992cbb074b7f3660085814aa16f08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1edb78b797847c2bf945f2c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…米浴，没问题的。\n…累了什么的，没有…\n没问题，的哦…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70714ff7a63c82917862002d156d17e81e9f9b0b734e261ae9af8e99ca5fc7bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80390138ab12598e8eaa09a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，精神满满\n我会加油的…！\n交给我吧，哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34a0fc36d0ea7d715ed89e59515653c3a6ea4bdfeca58b78e6a9cb91586637f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441bd9241d1712b71c60165f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个呢，热身\n已经完成了！\n现在开始干什么都行哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b909d0a1300bafad3041959778bed2e2163aeb04800f59d217775de43a51b46e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf75b1a1e1fb173ef940c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油咯ー，哦ー！\n今天也请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d1bd85f1fa03987a553f40581585b754f01eab4d8a59bdd78846ea3f9d9d3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e94576ee403dbf3a642637f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，去训练吧？\n因为现在的话\n能够充分努力哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb991f1514b73a2e7efa08b873c6e3ad8a4fa4c8d5b18567d28aaab3986b8e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1053e26de92389f2f64992b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打算做什么训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "459034254c7f570fa497ea617a93979a8d93ebf778f04a6ce00823892b2838a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db6128fac4dbb29bf478180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让你失望，\n要加油了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bd6be1408c8f3240f3b53bce7d2a98d72e6280b354014d3b7b2651038d7c0db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30cc081485f88dde76b19863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜～…\n加油米浴…加油～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "364f2a8033802dbf0946250a1e5acf6037cdb03154b8e7bc42985dddef5b5d0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235a6e17cafcd7f51d2c77f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会有什么是米浴\n能做到的事吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "af984c590de753b7f0ebde9f1b661c0d7e6f6737f6c62fbe7d6b741cf5ca2b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc0b3fb8b08d78c4a19c32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜呜…明明不想\n给哥哥添麻烦的…\n对不起…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8826f4a8b177c7100d753e1121b27d3ddf42945075b361968bc417a3ce7b27d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03674b5af1c14795e55970e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…又要，变回\n没用的孩子了吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "101e7b2c4a7d4c27a1285c1a1572c165bb420c686ce4f4cdd517a534fd536f77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4adff3d5f99e5246a81b1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜诶？又要比赛吗…？\n啊…没，没关系的…！\n米浴，会加油的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af4eb66033f2835d634ac11654b4b23838d17b81a87b7c80c18d9a858dcdea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a98d371018b6a0ea8046b14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…怎么办啊，脚已经…\n不，还…还能努力。\n比赛应该也能顺利进行…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1858ab9f30acba43b3324fd0ad24b3190bd288bceeb16eea715bad023b485442",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c86e4ac806a73d47baf5f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "剩下的就该全力以赴了…\n对吧，哥哥…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d7a3261a45223cd712f98ebd064d42f3a86cec0f765babe7680da4d99192050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d8a86ae51be87b75c6e66a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好跑到最后呢…！\n要加油咯ー、哦ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db78daa3326cb2e1ccd7afc71daace09497e978287f51a8951d7209468f33da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82836f9082d63306cdfa4767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始前就觉得\n会是场好比赛…好兴奋啊。\n今天…很期待跑步呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82d9df4f7cdb6489dc559bbc690c2fc9a7adc17e901ac78d746f2d6489cc448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee58129dd010a218c310c0bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，好…!\n还没，开始吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a1cec0d42c731b69c6dbf577f9380a550d240df0f821023ce8880daa183dba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8fcea40192234bfa213ccd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为和哥哥\n一起做了很多训练…！\n我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c75b36f3cc27cbd6c768d16d6060b47cbfe71c3e5b6730257366ee3bdf85e9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8efee2deb3c79443fd3dd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能做到的…能做到的。\n嗯，没问题…\n米浴，出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b8df52565bd91124f8698b4a549cafc24ea437c7822d8d72008bca2fa8ed94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cef3fe7cf90fe61f6acb2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，已经开始了…！？\n我，我会加油的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac66a5020dc29827d651b9686f723750ea9cddfba69ed18dd89767f93bb04357",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ea6d85887d83bf36b0f957",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸，呼…\n不要害怕，不要害怕…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ee7c02ece212a7629d286e55e3e9d7b44cc588e04f1a6ee359b5aa00a8c986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f55c9c61ad16b65dbfad9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛前\n果然会心跳加快呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce778e14d0de27b43e309d935edb0d2c84d82210b69fa4dbfcc7d43b166cc93a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4a540403bd19d5e0579a1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行不行，不能变得不安…！\n加油米浴，加油～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "86bae3eade96e285721446695848fd260735b326eb39c656ecce1c203cf59bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b63d1d63291746063f0b712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，有点发抖了…\n那个，哥哥…稍微一会儿…\n我可以握着你的手吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4739b1b8019e67d005137892d3941edfc1cd2657bba474c90deeff775d67b491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
